{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32507","headline":"句 · 段成式","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高谈敬风鉴，古貌怯冰棱。\n虱暴妨归梦，虫喧彻曙更。\n梦里思甘露，言中惜惠灯。\n新破毗昙义，相期卜夜论。\n随樵劫猨藏，隈石觑熊缘。\n[捽]胡云彩落，疻面月痕消。\n掷履仙凫起，撦衣蝴蝶飘。\n羞中含薄怒，颦里带余娇。\n醒後犹攘臂，归时更折腰。\n狂夫自缨绝，眉势倩人描。\n不愿石郎戴笠，难甘玉女披衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段成式","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32507.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32507","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}